        <activityName xml:lang="en">Waste, non-hazardous, from combined oil and gas production, offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Waste, non-hazardous, from combined oil and gas production, offshore
Without waste going to recycling (glass, metals, paper, cardboard).;
UUID: 4422f302-9405-3bab-990b-1411ee2077be
This dataset includes all non-hazardous wastes from the combined offshore oil and gas production on the Norwegian Continental Shelf. These are blasting sand, EE-waste, glass, food waste, plastics, wood and other. Metal, cardboard and paper waste are assumed to go to recycling and are therefore not included in this dataset.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Waste treatment technology according to Swiss standard.
Time period: 2010
Production volume: 14766t waste in 2010
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4422f302-9405-3bab-990b-1411ee2077be.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
